hran_admin_kpi
=============


Library to download admin cli and run scripts with it

If you see errorCode:9 and requestMessage:'License not available'
you need to change SCF parameter `actCLI` to `true`

Requirements
============


* Python>=2.7.10



Installation
============


Test lines with HRAN workspace
------------------------------


pip install -U hran_admin_cli


Test lines without HRAN workspace
---------------------------------


pip install -U -i https://pypi.dynamic.nsn-net.net/panda/pypi hran_admin_cli


